<description><![CDATA[<div>美国航班停飞禁令已经解除，可以恢复航班起飞，但恢复正常需要一段时间。<br/>交通部长肖恩·达菲称，美国的航路交通管制系统非常老旧，路由器数据过载，不同路由器的数据不一致，因此导致系统关闭。达菲呼吁国会紧急拨款用于系统升级。<br/>（<a href="https://apnews.com/live/ground-stop-aviation-flights-news-updates-11-13-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>，<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/11/13/us/live-news/flights-ground-stop-faa" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">CNN</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Nzu7FBz6PdwdOeGbKMhKpohTvLDM9w4QtmSnJ1_2yZfwb0O6uca0ZbhOEdMtUwEkbxkx-zKe5nJnIHvhEQ-30yg9n_lIw61BfhlW6T53CtzK4CtPvijnp74gZWnzuTU-hBTVmolMo7yEIIjl9wiqk48073S1xUcnxnCd_-8Nn7-g6kW7g4HD21XcIKZ0er2K2NoWX5w6dGEtOii91zrNsYE6HsG6qdPaoG910rz8dFHVloFciakAxOZ2iF-OM2Bdoh5q6YgJbOz3OmmuHCuAG1PQPcMugVjtvt1S5zfEfpLIuevhJuKslMAi438CHPY2VDu9Wlxyy3Lf4rrGFRuBnw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
